{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "9e4a89c4ba3d6fc9dfdc5d2feebdbd5bc6a0a73876376728e3d7e72cae09f253", "ja": "変わらぬ願い", "zh": "不变的心愿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2f74270b1c3435f674a1b1d9e04cd357e74ae16a7cdcd87fe72ab75b475b62b6", "ja": "ショックで、すっかり人が変わったように\n塞ぎ込む海美。静香と琴葉の作戦で、あずさ\nと会話をする。そこで、あずさの心が初めて\n出会った頃と少しも変わっていない事に\n気付き、その思いに触れた海美は涙を流す。", "zh": "受到打击的海美仿佛变了个人，整日郁郁寡欢。静香和琴叶制定计划，让她和梓交谈。在那之后，海美发现梓的内心和初次相遇时相比丝毫未变。感受到这份心意的海美流下了眼泪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1000_students", "source_sha256": "4a9117146c4d0742330d7d03b09198c91af728a7512a422ae352a6f73c7c0ba7", "ja": "最近の高坂さん、なんだか雰囲気が\n変わってしまわれたわね……。", "zh": "最近的高坂小姐，总感觉气质变了呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1001_students", "source_sha256": "e0b3e77121ea89a51dd7bdd42bf5a2002aa1e5804e4c9e50981b48d08c59c93d", "ja": "ええ。凛としたお姿が素敵な方でしたけれど、\n今は行き過ぎて、人を寄せつけないよう……。", "zh": "是的。她曾是一位身姿凛然、十分迷人的人，可如今却走得太远，仿佛不让任何人靠近……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "f28ecb32ec741fef9bb7a2cb63a65c95d28cc8a1742071b5763b283ad7e41cb3", "ja": "海美、フルーツパーラーの招待券をいただいたの。\n帰りに寄ってみない？　パフェがおいしいって評判よ。", "zh": "海美，我拿到了水果甜品店的邀请券。回去的时候要不要去看看？听说那里的芭菲很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "15fc33a39422aa8064cd7575f02c0daaeaa9f49d15dd59ebdb8f79aad2f0d976", "ja": "ごめんなさい、気分が悪いの。\n遠慮させてもらうわ。", "zh": "对不起，我有点不舒服。\n这次就不去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "be62742a31d0edf27faf5454fef2b2b3acc378c96a181ee9d22e4c1a792079b3", "ja": "そ、そう。それなら、仕方ないわね……。\nなら、琴葉お姉さまを誘ってみるわ。", "zh": "这、这样啊。那就没办法了……\n那我去试着邀请琴叶姐姐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "fcb259e5efb8e6af91c74efff03575c49ad1cd587910100ff3db2c55b0633b9a", "ja": "海美……あの。\nあまり、無理しないようにね……？", "zh": "海美……那个。\n你可别太勉强自己了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "1a0a0c152ff87b1ed7f8864884e9c175928d612b6402090538cce69026d738f8", "ja": "無理……？　静香ったら、何を言っているのかしら。\n私は、無理なんて何もしてないのに。", "zh": "勉强？静香真是的，不知道在说什么呢。\n我明明什么都没勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "4ee70837e9e2b2b69ae5847ab2a58687e85e76fcb28581aece3bc67bc3e0c44f", "ja": "……。\n……帰ろう。", "zh": "……。\n……回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "d8fc0b441e8b3aa4c0878e2495619ae34db67ba7191037552898394a4c821937", "ja": "海美、行ったみたいね。\n……あ、琴葉お姉さまですか？　静香です。", "zh": "海美好像已经走了。\n……啊，是琴叶姐姐吗？我是静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "f8865c8f35f22c12e95667903972fc8dfbc0e68fe9755d5b1389ec4035dbad71", "ja": "海美が今、教室を出て行きました。誘いには、乗って\nくれなかったので……はい。よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "海美刚刚离开教室。因为她没有接受我的邀请……是的。那就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "fed09a266cd31732b507a5098a83e41843d9fccd07129a9e115e3b76136a157f", "ja": "これでよし、と。……あとは、ミス・ラベンダーと\nちゃんと話せるといいんだけど。", "zh": "这样就好了。……接下来，要是也能和薰衣草小姐好好聊聊就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "da2676dca0a7fb562e3918e0d610f49434ef5a8a13d13e10d69ed68d307b0b2b", "ja": "ああ、海美ちゃん……！\nよかった、まだ学校にいたのね。", "zh": "啊，海美……！\n太好了，你还在学校。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "088a2bf885aa3f7b99194745b04512db82e386ff7146be01e1f55dc115b208f5", "ja": "！　……あずさお姉さま……。", "zh": "！……梓姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "4b7838ec8e905c8d10e822b1ce1dcff7a1788287814353f37408f837e56c9c7d", "ja": "ええ。海美ちゃんとどうしても\nお話がしたくて、ここで待っていたの。", "zh": "嗯。我无论如何都想和海美聊聊，所以一直在这里等着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "50d9a6e9dab91a5a09433e3286dccdc98ec42969033f1aaa128021647c68b49a", "ja": "私とお話……あの転校生のことですか？", "zh": "要和我谈话……是关于那个转校生的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "c579b182c5c9d06a38cf0585578b0452ebe983ba0906667bbcf2c91063b9a1fe", "ja": "え？　……ええ、そうね。\n育ちゃんにも、関係あるけど……。", "zh": "咦？……嗯，是啊。和育也有关系，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "1469e8aea9c626ef19c935ea741dc8afcb62408c07f4c24f068b08cc5c199d14", "ja": "だったら、聞きたくありません……。", "zh": "既然这样，我不想听……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "be677832307441d71865f1595fdf4f5813de3de6347938243b479aa62336bd58", "ja": "海美ちゃん？", "zh": "海美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "31681ba745d6b6fe0f73678b99773c6f5a09deaf790fa2169e19e9022c7bc52f", "ja": "私……私はっ。あずさお姉さまのためなら、\nなんでもできるって思ってました！　けど……。", "zh": "我……我呀。我一直觉得，为了亚里沙姐姐，\n什么都能做到！可是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "a84a9f98de833b368653466f4a11eaea1b123e72983c5181f5d12dce3011eaa4", "ja": "あの子と仲良くするのだけは、私にはできない……。", "zh": "唯独和那个孩子搞好关系，我是做不到的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "8e7986dbdefe64abf133ee3af6b1e4c5bbfb8e17c17a9ca6a20ec75315165201", "ja": "……。それはどうしてか、聞いてもいい？", "zh": "……。能问问你那是为什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "da5de2553ea584a8cf0d961bcdf13e3f54166a0d0813fe463085ed2a5ed4bcb4", "ja": "それは……お、お姉さまが私より、\nあの子のことのほうが……グスッ。", "zh": "那是因为……姐、姐姐她，比起我，更在乎那个孩子……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "73bc3d7c3449ae4cc1c001e0da438e61ae23a95b4da9b49676e43b49b04aedb0", "ja": "お姉さまは、あの子のほうが大事で！　私はあの子の\n代わりなんだって、そんなこと知りたくなかった……！", "zh": "姐姐更看重那个孩子！我只是代替那个孩子的……这种事，我根本不想知道……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "253247adbb23f1071edac4bc8e37aff3bb4d657fd48581b6d18785511e65cff8", "ja": "海美ちゃん……。", "zh": "海美……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "b000ea3361d767304e6f63b300170cede9c417a67e7ca99cfe29335fad35757e", "ja": "心配させてしまったみたいで、ごめんなさいね。\n上手く言えるかどうか、自信はないのだけれど……。", "zh": "看来让你担心了呢，真抱歉。\n虽然我也没有把握能不能说清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "9478032c58607a0b198f6edb1912ed9c32ab6913c6f796dacd60ed8c63cb3012", "ja": "私は、来年卒業してしまうでしょう？　海美ちゃんに\nお友達がいるかどうか、ずっと気になっていたの。", "zh": "我明年就要毕业了，对吧？所以一直很在意海美有没有朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "4998ab280d789719a47a2cedadbf7a7ebd6d77233f18debb231e010e900d1c10", "ja": "でもそれは、余計な心配だったってわかったわ。\n本当にごめんなさいね。", "zh": "不过后来我才发现，那是我多余的担心。\n真的很抱歉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "0514f5ac4939a42bafd8a34a735d85d7119f0d4f539051c7fb800941f8353472", "ja": "育ちゃんは、年下だけどとてもしっかりしているの。\n大切な海美ちゃんを、預けてもいいって思えるくらい。", "zh": "育虽然年纪比我小，却非常可靠。可靠到让我觉得，可以把重要的海美托付给她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "01e316811fc9729e3f7cd2e178af3d29e5ee4031685ea288ed0368a70ea67eff", "ja": "お姉さま……。\nあ……じゃあ、私のために……？", "zh": "姐姐大人……  \n啊……那，是为了我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "e5aee086448f14ffaa594ead3b64e162bb52394eecbea32f0d4f80121c6a8f73", "ja": "もちろん、私のためでもあるわ。私は海美ちゃんも、\n育ちゃんも大好き。ふたりとも、とっても大切なの。", "zh": "当然也是为了我自己。海美和育，我都很喜欢。你们两个对我来说都非常重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1031_010azu", "source_sha256": "cbdda3d2f681ed799032cc7ad66ad65e88fefd08c9db4f150076c998c4106fa7", "ja": "……ねえ、海美ちゃん。もう一度、私が育ちゃんと\n仲良くしてほしいって言ったら、聞いてくれる？", "zh": "……那个，海美。如果我再请求你和育好好相处一次，你愿意听我的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "f0c872b5234f3df1f06ecbea574a71c3ee46693e654548c3ea7e5d2e0e3857e7", "ja": "……。お姉さまが、\nそうおっしゃるなら……。", "zh": "……。既然姐姐大人\n都这么说了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1033_010azu", "source_sha256": "b91acef09d2e43ae96103fbf7bd0b1f36f6c06e6bc1032fd589092df0b50f410", "ja": "そうじゃないわ。\n……私にお願いされたからでは、ダメなの。", "zh": "不是那样的。\n……如果只是因为我的请求，那是不行的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1034_010azu", "source_sha256": "23f0828b725404b734c91a5a0d8db45db73d5d90584e9fa82d7b2fe8574b6692", "ja": "海美ちゃんが育ちゃんと心から仲良くしたいと\n思っていないのなら、それは私の願いではないのよ。", "zh": "如果海美不是真心想和育成为好朋友，那就不是我的愿望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1035_010azu", "source_sha256": "bffdc4c1b949976946e2e9e5dafa8be61969d5bcdad3948ccc78c6079d52a54d", "ja": "私は、海美ちゃんが心から笑った顔が見たいだけ。\n初めて出会ったあの日から、ずっと、それだけなの。", "zh": "我只是想看到海美发自内心的笑容。从第一次见到你的那天起，一直都只是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "e0263c5353610c6d71ce3cd59cba28f0bbb9809004c5e0599f3662f232ff419e", "ja": "初めて会った……あの日から、ずっと……？\nじゃあお姉さまは、ずっと……。", "zh": "从我们第一次见面……那天起，一直……？\n那么，姐姐一直都……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "8c974abc0c51b6b19b2b69182167facbb3582de1d6a0cd561b88f349effbfc1b", "ja": "お姉さま……私……。", "zh": "姐姐……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1038_010azu", "source_sha256": "1d866468d4473f1f02967ec81be4e3e216630d6ab7350a7366400720775ff1d3", "ja": "あらあら……。かわいい海美ちゃんを\n泣かせてしまうなんて、私は、悪いお姉さまね？", "zh": "哎呀哎呀……把这么可爱的海美\n弄哭了，我还真是一个坏姐姐呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "e7027c61abb104c4f730a396be68901f07346de45dffe7f814e92aab84e4999b", "ja": "っ……違うんです！\n私が、私が勝手にっ……うわーん……！！", "zh": "呜……不是的！是我、是我自作主张……呜哇——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "c1f974413e9902c8771f6b8b35e18241d80cf7fee50cb9738d4947ffb7992e89", "ja": "うぐぅ……よ、よかったぁ……。\nよかったわね、海美……！", "zh": "呜呜……太、太好了……\n太好了呢，海美……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1041_017kth", "source_sha256": "9a7fdeb819f2afef894144f9d4d1054895313130bf7fddbc0d5ba075afa2e8d2", "ja": "お疲れさまだったわね。……それにしても、静香さんは\nあの子のことを、とても大事に思っているのね。", "zh": "辛苦你了……不过话说回来，静香小姐真的很在乎那个孩子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1042_017kth", "source_sha256": "99063aae9d3ffd326f66994e52679a0a7ffdfa8b3315b0f66a288b88019c91c4", "ja": "今回の件、ミス・ラベンダーに\nものすごい剣幕で詰め寄ったって聞いたけど……。", "zh": "听说你因为这次的事，气势汹汹地逼问了薰衣草小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "aa3880f4f94df75cac9c9c26919dd71646f7837bd7f2fe5b357f18dee40686e1", "ja": "ええっ！？　あ、あれは、その……！\nミス・ラベンダーには失礼なことをしてしまって……。", "zh": "诶！？那、那个……！\n我对薰衣草小姐做了很失礼的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_05_1044_017kth", "source_sha256": "b50f095cc5ac8cde105107e7240218f7fafd9aa0e6705ddfd095149d93581064", "ja": "ふふ、大丈夫。……それに彼女も、言葉で気持ちを\n伝えることの大切さに、気付けたみたいだから……。", "zh": "呵呵，没事的。……而且她似乎也意识到了，用语言传达心意的重要性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
